# WarriorCorpseZombieDDMagicAggressive (21570, level 69, damage magic 4592-6), teleporting (the ai line sets
# IsTeleport), every draw 0: settled and attacking nobody, a character it sees 300 away makes it abort and
# teleport onto the character's position and want the teleport skill 4671-1 on it (1000000). It lands outside
# its spawn territory (the sphere of its drift range), so it adds no attack desire and, 0 away, no damage magic.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCorpseZombie.WarriorCorpseZombie
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCorpseZombie.WarriorCorpseZombieDDMagic
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCorpseZombie.WarriorCorpseZombieDDMagicAggressive
npc zombie 21570 Monster 300 0 0 level 69 aggro 1000 skill DD_MAGIC 4592 6 ai IsTeleport=1
roll zombie 99

tick x8
away
approach zombie 300
  S MagicSkillUse caster=zombie target=player skill=4671-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  at zombie 0 0 0
  desires zombie cast(player,4671,move)=1000000
